jobs.description:
You Have:  
**o TS/SCI clearance with a polygraph; through MD**  
o Experience developing software using **Python or Java;**  
o Experience in **data modeling**, including with normalization of data and working with metrics;  
o Experience developing and maintaining web-based server applications and implementing algorithms that interface with relational databases such as MySQL or PostgreSQL;  
o Experience developing task automation using AWS API;  
o Experience with Linux and shell scripting;  
o Ability to design, develop, and implement data processing workflows;  
o Ability to develop and optimize data structures within and between routines and for data storage and retrieval using JSON, YAML, or NoSQL Databases;  
o Bachelor’s degree in a Computer Science field and 14+ years of experience with general software engineering in a Linux environment, or 18+ years of experience with general software engineering in a Linux environment in lieu of a degree.  

Nice to Have:  

o Experience working with containers;  
o Experience developing CI/CD pipelines with GitLab CI;  
o Experience with Infrastructure as Code (IAC) and tooling, including Terraform;  
o Experience with mono-repo architecture and tooling;  
o Experience with Web page design in JavaScript, Angular, or Python Shiny;  
o Experience developing pipelines using the AWS API, to include Lambda and Step functions;  
o Knowledge of network protocols such as NMP or BGP;  
o Ability to work in an ambiguous, fast-paced, highly collaborative, and team-oriented environment and balance long- and short-term taskings.  
o Experience with unstructured databases, including Mongo or Elasticsearch, and graph databases, including Neo4J;  
o Experience with implementation of test environments for automated code validation

